                  <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[#5c7300] font-bold">→</span> Requirements ≠ specification of works</li>
                  <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[#5c7300] font-bold">→</span> Ten mandatory tender areas</li>
